CONTEXT OnlyClassified
-- B is a specialisation of the marked concept A and occurs in CLASSIFY only.
-- B needs a table of its own, just as it gets a column in the wide table without the mark.
CLASSIFY B ISA A
CLASSIFY C ISA A
REPRESENT A TYPE MULTITABLE
RELATION naam[A*Text] [UNI]
RELATION rc[C*Text] [UNI]
ENDCONTEXT
